# DLSS 5 Video Player: Simplified Chinese (zh-Hans).
#
# Drafted with an AI model on 2026-10-31. Not yet reviewed by a native
# speaker. Corrections are welcome as GitHub issues or pull requests.
#
# One `key = text` per line; the format is in src/TranslationFile.h and the
# English originals are in src/Localization.h. Keep every %s, %u, %d, \n and
# \t exactly as the English has them, in the same order, or the player drops
# the line and shows English. Keep " · " as it is: the toolbar splits labels
# on it. A menu path ("播放 > 停止") must spell the menu labels in this file.
# Product and technical names stay in English (DLSS 5, RTX VSR, NVIDIA,
# ReShade, RenoDX, YouTube, FFmpeg, HDR, SDR, VMAF, NVENC).

